From 085c722fefc06a935079b5588c21779175a22367 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 21:45:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add shareholder email system, move approvals to admin-only
 sidebar

- New apps/core/emails.py: centralized, best-effort email sending
  (welcome email on email change, withdrawal approved/rejected,
  voucher batch approved, share increase approved to all shareholders,
  admin notification to nabiswaj8@gmail.com on every new withdrawal
  request, and a custom/compose email for meetings & announcements).
- Gmail SMTP settings added to config/settings.py (env-driven; falls
  back to console backend if unset).
- Withdrawal Requests and Voucher Approvals moved off the Revenue and
  Vouchers pages into their own Main-Admin-only sidebar pages, with
  pending-count badges (new admin_action_badges context processor).
- New 'Send Email' admin page for ad-hoc shareholder announcements.
- Real-time client-side validation on the withdrawal amount field:
  green check/enabled submit when within the available balance, red
  cross/disabled submit otherwise.
- DEPLOY.md updated with the new EMAIL_* / ADMIN_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL
  env vars; added a .gitignore for __pycache__/env files.
